sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor u as Клиент
    participant g as API Gateway
    participant v as UserEvents Service
    participant k as Kafka (events)
    participant ch as ClickHouse
    participant db as PostgreSQL WAL
    participant d as Debezium
    u-->>g: Событие просмотра / клика
    g-->>v: Передать пользовательское событие
    v-->>k: Produce user_events
    k-->>ch: Ingest user_events (consumer/connector)
    db-->>d: Событие изменения бизнес-данных из WAL
    d-->>k: Produce business_changes (отдельный topic)
    k-->>ch: Ingest business_changes (consumer/connector)